### ===== TOKEN SETUP =====
### Paste your tokens here after logging in (from auth.http)
### Format: @variable_name = token_value

@admin_token =
@student_token =
@professor_token =

### ===== STUDENT ENDPOINTS =====
### This file contains all student-related requests with role-based access tests
### Token Variables: @admin_token, @professor_token, @student_token

### Admin: Get all students (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Get all students (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Get all students (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

###

### Admin: Get student by ID (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Get student by ID (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Get own student profile (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

###

### Admin: Create student (ALLOWED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2002-05-15",
  "email": "john@university.edu"
}

###

### Professor: Create student (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

{
  "id": 2,
  "userId": 2,
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2001-08-20",
  "email": "jane@university.edu"
}

###

### Student: Create student (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

{
  "id": 3,
  "userId": 3,
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Wilson",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2003-01-10",
  "email": "bob@university.edu"
}

###

### Admin: Update student (ALLOWED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe-Updated",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2002-05-15",
  "email": "john.updated@university.edu"
}

###

### Professor: Update student (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe-Modified",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2002-05-15",
  "email": "john@university.edu"
}

###

### Admin: Delete student (ALLOWED)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Delete student (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###
